        </li>
        <li>
          Grew the Experience Platform Debugger from 30K to 80K users as its
          sole engineer, shipping Chrome Manifest V3 three months before MV2
          shutdown by migrating to service workers, Parcel 2, and
          remote-code-free injection.
        </li>
        <li>
          Resolved 30 enterprise escalations (14 Blocker or Critical) by
          reproducing bugs on third-party production sites and shipping fixes,
          including a Critical telecom login fix merged in 38 minutes.
        </li>
        <li>
          Cut typing latency in Adobe Tags’ configuration UI from
          <span class="nowrap">140–209 ms</span> to
          <span class="nowrap">8–15 ms</span> (10× faster) by replacing Formik,
          which re-rendered every form on each keystroke, with TanStack Form.
        </li>
        <li>
          Raised team engineering standards by leading the UI &amp; React
          interview loop, authoring the on-call runbook, and reviewing 500+ PRs
          across the Web SDK.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h3>
        Software Developer, ICE Mortgage Technology (Simplifile)<span
          class="print-sep"
        >
          |
        </span><span class="dates">Jan 2019 – Jan 2022</span>
      </h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Built and maintained customer-facing frontend features in Simplifile’s
          real-estate e-recording app, and mentored bootcamp-trained support
          technicians through their first year as engineers.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h3>
        Software Engineering Intern, Lingotek<span class="print-sep"> | </span
        ><span class="dates">May 2018 – Dec 2018</span>
      </h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Improved main app page load times by 15% while migrating views to
          Vue.js and cut build times by 25%.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h3>
        Front-End Web Developer, Brigham Young University<span
          class="print-sep"
        >
          |
        </span><span class="dates">Feb 2016 – May 2018</span>
      </h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Built features for Learning Suite, BYU’s learning management system,
