        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <p>
      <strong><a href="https://yazzy.carter.works">Yazzy</a></strong>: reader
      mode (5,600+ articles) |
      <strong
        ><a href="https://github.com/carterworks/substack-to-epub"
